<title>USA: Heartstream defibrillator gets clearance.</title>
<headline>Heartstream defibrillator gets clearance.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE, Wash. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartstream Inc said the U.S. Food and Drug Administration had granted it clearance to market its ForeRunner defibrillator in the U.S.</p>
<p>The ForeRunner is used in the treatment of sudden cardiac arrest, the leading cause of death in the United States.</p>
